<%- include('partials/header') %><section class="page-intro left-intro"><span class="eyebrow">SMART TRAVEL PLANNER</span><h1>Make room for <em>the good stuff.</em></h1><p>Tell us what your trip looks like. Get a practical starter estimate for your Bangladesh adventure.</p></section><section class="planner-layout"><form class="planner-form" method="post" action="/planner"><div class="form-heading"><span class="step-number">01</span><div><h2>Your destination</h2><p>Where are you dreaming of going?</p></div></div><label>Choose a destination<select required name="destination_id"><option value="">Select a destination</option><% destinations.forEach(d=>{ %><option value="<%= d.id %>" <%= result&&result.destination.id===d.id?'selected':'' %>><%= d.name %><%= d.district?' · '+d.district:'' %></option><% }) %></select></label><div class="form-heading"><span class="step-number">02</span><div><h2>Trip details</h2><p>A few basics help shape your estimate.</p></div></div><div class="form-row"><label>Days<input type="number" name="days" min="1" max="30" value="<%= result?result.days:3 %>" required></label><label>Travellers<input type="number" name="travelers" min="1" max="50" value="<%= result?result.people:2 %>" required></label></div><label>Budget for everyone (BDT)<input type="number" name="budget" min="0" step="100" value="<%= result?result.budget:15000 %>"></label><label>Transport estimate per traveller (BDT)<input type="number" name="transport_cost" min="0" step="100" value="1500"></label><button class="btn btn-primary btn-full">Calculate my trip <span>→</span></button><p class="form-note">Estimates are indicative, based on available local pricing. Actual costs may vary.</p></form><div class="planner-result"><% if(result){ %><span class="eyebrow">YOUR STARTER ESTIMATE</span><h2><%= result.destination.name %></h2><p><%= result.days %> days · <%= result.people %> traveller<%= result.people===1?'':'s' %></p><div class="estimate-total"><small>Estimated total</small><strong>৳ <%= money(result.total) %></strong><span>৳ <%= money(result.perPerson) %> per person</span></div><div class="cost-list"><div><span>Stay</span><b>৳ <%= money(result.hotelCost) %></b></div><div><span>Food & water</span><b>৳ <%= money(result.foodCost) %></b></div><div><span>Activities & entry</span><b>৳ <%= money(result.activityCost) %></b></div><div><span>Transport</span><b>৳ <%= money(result.transport) %></b></div></div><div class="budget-status <%= result.fits?'fits':'over' %>"><span><%= result.fits?'✓':'!' %></span><div><b><%= result.fits?'Within your budget':'Over your budget' %></b><small><%= result.remaining>=0?'৳ '+money(result.remaining)+' remaining':'৳ '+money(Math.abs(result.remaining))+' over budget' %></small></div></div><% if(user&&user.role==='tourist'){ %><form method="post" action="/trips/save"><input type="hidden" name="destination_id" value="<%= result.destination.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="days" value="<%= result.days %>"><input type="hidden" name="travelers" value="<%= result.people %>"><input type="hidden" name="budget" value="<%= result.budget %>"><input type="hidden" name="total" value="<%= result.total %>"><button class="btn btn-dark btn-full">Save this plan ↗</button></form><% }else{ %><a class="btn btn-dark btn-full" href="/login">Sign in to save your plan ↗</a><% } %><% if(result.attractions.length){ %><div class="suggested"><h3>Worth a look</h3><% result.attractions.forEach(a=>{ %><a href="/attractions/<%= a.id %>"><span><%= a.name %></span><small>৳ <%= money(a.entrance_fee_bdt) %> ↗</small></a><% }) %></div><% } %><% } else { %><div class="result-placeholder"><div class="placeholder-icon">↗</div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR JOURNEY, AT A GLANCE</span><h2>Your trip plan<br>starts with an idea.</h2><p>Complete the details to see a cost breakdown, compare it with your budget and start planning the fun parts.</p><div class="placeholder-line"></div><div class="placeholder-line short"></div><div class="placeholder-line"></div></div><% } %></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
